{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1310717001:0":{"text":"メイジさん！その魔法は違います！","source_cn":"魔法师先生，请等等——你又用错魔法了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB99A0B43AE05774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310717002:0":{"text":"それは、無機物への使用を禁じられている、生命力を強める魔法です！それだと雪だるまが暴走しちゃいます！","source_cn":"你准备使用的魔法是增强生命力的，不能给无生命物体使用，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2862E820CCD1E4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310717003:0":{"text":"え！？だって、魔法書にはちゃんと……","source_cn":"什么？不可能！我的法术书上是这么写的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4AB970AB7C2317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1310717003":{"text":"え！？だって、魔法書にはちゃんと……","source_cn":"什么？不可能！我的法术书上是这么写的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4AB970AB7C2317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310717004:0":{"text":"まったく、何を言って――\nう、確かに「非活性物への使用を禁ずる」って書いてある……","source_cn":"哼，让我来教教你！\\n咦，好像确实……“不能对非活性物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C9FBE3E340621E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema